('9g3-w10-p246-q15-description',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p246-q15-description","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Apply dilations to linear functions","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"The parent function is $f(x)=x$, shown on the graph. For $g(x)=f(0.4x)$, which statement describes the horizontal dilation?","promptAr":"الدالة الأم $f(x)=x$ موضحة بالرسم. أي عبارة تصف التمدد الأفقي في $g(x)=f(0.4x)$؟","answer":"Replacing $x$ with $kx$ scales horizontal distances by $1/k$. Here $k=0.4>0$, so the factor is $\\frac52$ and the graph stretches horizontally. Also $g(x)=0.4x$, so it passes through the origin with slope $0.4$.","answerAr":"التعويض عن $x$ بـ $kx$ يضرب المسافات الأفقية في $1/k$. هنا $k=0.4>0$، لذا المعامل $\\frac52$ ويحدث تمدد أفقي. كما أن $g(x)=0.4x$، فيمر الرسم بنقطة الأصل وميله $0.4$.","options":["Translation 0.4 units to the right.","Reflection across the y-axis and scaling by $\\frac52$.","Horizontal stretch by a factor of $\\frac52$.","Horizontal compression by a factor of $\\frac52$."],"optionsAr":["إزاحة إلى اليمين بمقدار $0.4$ وحدة.","انعكاس حول محور الصادات وتمدد بمعامل $\\frac52$.","تمدد أفقي بمعامل $\\frac52$.","انضغاط أفقي بمعامل $\\frac52$."],"sourcePage":246,"sourceQuestion":15,"sourcePart":"description","linearGraph":{"coefficients":[1,0],"bounds":[-5,5,-5,5]},"linearFunctionDilation":{"k":0.4,"kind":"description"},"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p246-q15-graph',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p246-q15-graph","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Apply dilations to linear functions","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"The parent function is $f(x)=x$. Which graph represents $g(x)=f(0.4x)$? All graphs use the same unit scale.","promptAr":"الدالة الأم $f(x)=x$. أي رسم يمثل $g(x)=f(0.4x)$؟ الرسوم تستخدم المقياس نفسه.","answer":"Replacing $x$ with $kx$ scales horizontal distances by $1/k$. Here $k=0.4>0$, so the factor is $\\frac52$ and the graph stretches horizontally. Also $g(x)=0.4x$, so it passes through the origin with slope $0.4$.","answerAr":"التعويض عن $x$ بـ $kx$ يضرب المسافات الأفقية في $1/k$. هنا $k=0.4>0$، لذا المعامل $\\frac52$ ويحدث تمدد أفقي. كما أن $g(x)=0.4x$، فيمر الرسم بنقطة الأصل وميله $0.4$.","options":["Graph B","Graph C","Graph D","Graph A"],"optionsAr":["الرسم B","الرسم C","الرسم D","الرسم A"],"sourcePage":246,"sourceQuestion":15,"sourcePart":"graph","linearFunctionDilation":{"k":0.4,"kind":"graph"},"linearChoices":{"bounds":[-5,5,-5,5],"target":{"kind":"line","m":0.4,"b":0},"choices":[{"kind":"line","m":2.5,"b":0},{"kind":"line","m":-0.4,"b":0},{"kind":"line","m":1,"b":0.4},{"kind":"line","m":0.4,"b":0}]},"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q28-argument',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q28-argument","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Is $-9,\\ -12,\\ -15,\\ -18$, … an arithmetic sequence? Choose the valid argument.","promptAr":"هل $-9,\\ -12,\\ -15,\\ -18$، … متتابعة حسابية؟ اختر التعليل الصحيح.","answer":"The differences are $-3,\\ -3,\\ -3$, so the common difference is $d=-3$ and the sequence is arithmetic.","answerAr":"الفروق هي $-3,\\ -3,\\ -3$؛ إذن الفرق المشترك $d=-3$ والمتتابعة حسابية.","options":["Yes. Consecutive differences are all $-3$.","No. An arithmetic sequence must have a positive common difference.","No. Arithmetic sequences must start at zero.","No. Consecutive terms must have a constant ratio."],"optionsAr":["نعم؛ الفروق بين الحدود المتتالية تساوي جميعها $-3$.","لا؛ يجب أن يكون الفرق المشترك موجباً.","لا؛ يجب أن تبدأ المتتابعة الحسابية بالصفر.","لا؛ يجب أن تكون النسبة بين الحدود المتتالية ثابتة."],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":28,"sourcePart":"argument","sequence":{"terms":[-9,-12,-15,-18],"kind":"argument","choiceValues":[true,false,false,false]},"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q28-next',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q28-next","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find the next three terms of the arithmetic sequence $-9,\\ -12,\\ -15,\\ -18$, … .","promptAr":"أوجد الحدود الثلاثة التالية للمتتابعة الحسابية $-9,\\ -12,\\ -15,\\ -18$، … .","answer":"Add the common difference $d=-3$ repeatedly: $-21,\\ -24,\\ -27$.","answerAr":"نضيف الفرق المشترك $d=-3$ في كل مرة، فنحصل على $-21,\\ -24,\\ -27$.","options":["$-15,\\ -12,\\ -9$","$-21,\\ -24,\\ -27$","$-24,\\ -27,\\ -30$","$-18,\\ -21,\\ -24$"],"optionsAr":["$-15,\\ -12,\\ -9$","$-21,\\ -24,\\ -27$","$-24,\\ -27,\\ -30$","$-18,\\ -21,\\ -24$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":28,"sourcePart":"next-three","sequence":{"terms":[-9,-12,-15,-18],"kind":"next-three","choiceValues":[[-15,-12,-9],[-21,-24,-27],[-24,-27,-30],[-18,-21,-24]]},"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q28-nth',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q28-nth","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Which formula gives the nth term of $-9,\\ -12,\\ -15,\\ -18$, … for $n=1,2,3,\\ldots$?","promptAr":"أي صيغة تعطي الحد العام للمتتابعة $-9,\\ -12,\\ -15,\\ -18$، … حيث $n=1,2,3,\\ldots$؟","answer":"$a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-9+(n-1)(-3)=-3n-6$.","answerAr":"الحل: $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-9+(n-1)(-3)=-3n-6$.","options":["$a_n=-3n-9$","$a_n=-9n-3$","$a_n=-3n-6$","$a_n=3n-6$"],"optionsAr":["$a_n=-3n-9$","$a_n=-9n-3$","$a_n=-3n-6$","$a_n=3n-6$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":28,"sourcePart":"nth-term","sequence":{"terms":[-9,-12,-15,-18],"kind":"nth-term","choiceValues":[[-3,-9],[-9,-3],[-3,-6],[3,-6]]},"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q28-eleventh',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q28-eleventh","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find the 11th term of the arithmetic sequence $-9,\\ -12,\\ -15,\\ -18$, … .","promptAr":"أوجد الحد الحادي عشر للمتتابعة الحسابية $-9,\\ -12,\\ -15,\\ -18$، … .","answer":"$a_{11}=a_1+(11-1)d=-9+10(-3)=-39$.","answerAr":"الحل: $a_{11}=a_1+(11-1)d=-9+10(-3)=-39$.","options":["$-42$","$-36$","$21$","$-39$"],"optionsAr":["$-42$","$-36$","$21$","$-39$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":28,"sourcePart":"eleventh-term","sequence":{"terms":[-9,-12,-15,-18],"kind":"eleventh-term","choiceValues":[-42,-36,21,-39]},"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q29-argument',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q29-argument","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Is $10,\\ 15,\\ 25,\\ 40$, … an arithmetic sequence? Choose the valid argument.","promptAr":"هل $10,\\ 15,\\ 25,\\ 40$، … متتابعة حسابية؟ اختر التعليل الصحيح.","answer":"The differences are $15-10=5$, $25-15=10$, and $40-25=15$. They are unequal, so this is not an arithmetic sequence. Do not apply an arithmetic nth-term formula.","answerAr":"الفروق هي $15-10=5$ و$25-15=10$ و$40-25=15$، وهي غير متساوية؛ لذا ليست متتابعة حسابية ولا نطبق عليها صيغة الحد العام للمتتابعة الحسابية.","options":["No. Consecutive differences are $5,10,15$, which are not constant.","Yes. The difference between the first two terms is 5, so every difference must be 5.","Yes. All the terms are positive.","Yes. Increasing terms always form an arithmetic sequence."],"optionsAr":["لا؛ الفروق بين الحدود المتتالية هي $5,10,15$، وهي غير ثابتة.","نعم؛ الفرق بين أول حدين 5، لذا يجب أن تكون جميع الفروق 5.","نعم؛ جميع الحدود موجبة.","نعم؛ كل متتابعة متزايدة تكون حسابية."],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":29,"sourcePart":"argument","sequence":{"terms":[10,15,25,40],"kind":"argument","choiceValues":[false,true,true,true]},"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q30-argument',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q30-argument","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Is $-10,\\ -5,\\ 0,\\ 5$, … an arithmetic sequence? Choose the valid argument.","promptAr":"هل $-10,\\ -5,\\ 0,\\ 5$، … متتابعة حسابية؟ اختر التعليل الصحيح.","answer":"The differences are $5,\\ 5,\\ 5$, so the common difference is $d=5$ and the sequence is arithmetic.","answerAr":"الفروق هي $5,\\ 5,\\ 5$؛ إذن الفرق المشترك $d=5$ والمتتابعة حسابية.","options":["No. Consecutive terms must have a constant ratio.","Yes. Consecutive differences are all $5$.","No. An arithmetic sequence must have a positive common difference.","No. Arithmetic sequences must start at zero."],"optionsAr":["لا؛ يجب أن تكون النسبة بين الحدود المتتالية ثابتة.","نعم؛ الفروق بين الحدود المتتالية تساوي جميعها $5$.","لا؛ يجب أن يكون الفرق المشترك موجباً.","لا؛ يجب أن تبدأ المتتابعة الحسابية بالصفر."],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":30,"sourcePart":"argument","sequence":{"terms":[-10,-5,0,5],"kind":"argument","choiceValues":[false,true,false,false]},"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q30-next',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q30-next","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find the next three terms of the arithmetic sequence $-10,\\ -5,\\ 0,\\ 5$, … .","promptAr":"أوجد الحدود الثلاثة التالية للمتتابعة الحسابية $-10,\\ -5,\\ 0,\\ 5$، … .","answer":"Add the common difference $d=5$ repeatedly: $10,\\ 15,\\ 20$.","answerAr":"نضيف الفرق المشترك $d=5$ في كل مرة، فنحصل على $10,\\ 15,\\ 20$.","options":["$5,\\ 10,\\ 15$","$0,\\ -5,\\ -10$","$10,\\ 15,\\ 20$","$15,\\ 20,\\ 25$"],"optionsAr":["$5,\\ 10,\\ 15$","$0,\\ -5,\\ -10$","$10,\\ 15,\\ 20$","$15,\\ 20,\\ 25$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":30,"sourcePart":"next-three","sequence":{"terms":[-10,-5,0,5],"kind":"next-three","choiceValues":[[5,10,15],[0,-5,-10],[10,15,20],[15,20,25]]},"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q30-nth',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q30-nth","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Which formula gives the nth term of $-10,\\ -5,\\ 0,\\ 5$, … for $n=1,2,3,\\ldots$?","promptAr":"أي صيغة تعطي الحد العام للمتتابعة $-10,\\ -5,\\ 0,\\ 5$، … حيث $n=1,2,3,\\ldots$؟","answer":"$a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-10+(n-1)(5)=5n-15$.","answerAr":"الحل: $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-10+(n-1)(5)=5n-15$.","options":["$a_n=-5n-15$","$a_n=5n-10$","$a_n=-10n+5$","$a_n=5n-15$"],"optionsAr":["$a_n=-5n-15$","$a_n=5n-10$","$a_n=-10n+5$","$a_n=5n-15$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":30,"sourcePart":"nth-term","sequence":{"terms":[-10,-5,0,5],"kind":"nth-term","choiceValues":[[-5,-15],[5,-10],[-10,5],[5,-15]]},"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q30-eleventh',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q30-eleventh","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find the 11th term of the arithmetic sequence $-10,\\ -5,\\ 0,\\ 5$, … .","promptAr":"أوجد الحد الحادي عشر للمتتابعة الحسابية $-10,\\ -5,\\ 0,\\ 5$، … .","answer":"$a_{11}=a_1+(11-1)d=-10+10(5)=40$.","answerAr":"الحل: $a_{11}=a_1+(11-1)d=-10+10(5)=40$.","options":["$40$","$45$","$35$","$-60$"],"optionsAr":["$40$","$45$","$35$","$-60$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":30,"sourcePart":"eleventh-term","sequence":{"terms":[-10,-5,0,5],"kind":"eleventh-term","choiceValues":[40,45,35,-60]},"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q31-argument',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q31-argument","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Is $-5,\\ -3,\\ -1,\\ 1$, … an arithmetic sequence? Choose the valid argument.","promptAr":"هل $-5,\\ -3,\\ -1,\\ 1$، … متتابعة حسابية؟ اختر التعليل الصحيح.","answer":"The differences are $2,\\ 2,\\ 2$, so the common difference is $d=2$ and the sequence is arithmetic.","answerAr":"الفروق هي $2,\\ 2,\\ 2$؛ إذن الفرق المشترك $d=2$ والمتتابعة حسابية.","options":["No. Consecutive terms must have a constant ratio.","Yes. Consecutive differences are all $2$.","No. An arithmetic sequence must have a positive common difference.","No. Arithmetic sequences must start at zero."],"optionsAr":["لا؛ يجب أن تكون النسبة بين الحدود المتتالية ثابتة.","نعم؛ الفروق بين الحدود المتتالية تساوي جميعها $2$.","لا؛ يجب أن يكون الفرق المشترك موجباً.","لا؛ يجب أن تبدأ المتتابعة الحسابية بالصفر."],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":31,"sourcePart":"argument","sequence":{"terms":[-5,-3,-1,1],"kind":"argument","choiceValues":[false,true,false,false]},"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q31-next',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q31-next","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find the next three terms of the arithmetic sequence $-5,\\ -3,\\ -1,\\ 1$, … .","promptAr":"أوجد الحدود الثلاثة التالية للمتتابعة الحسابية $-5,\\ -3,\\ -1,\\ 1$، … .","answer":"Add the common difference $d=2$ repeatedly: $3,\\ 5,\\ 7$.","answerAr":"نضيف الفرق المشترك $d=2$ في كل مرة، فنحصل على $3,\\ 5,\\ 7$.","options":["$1,\\ 3,\\ 5$","$-1,\\ -3,\\ -5$","$3,\\ 5,\\ 7$","$5,\\ 7,\\ 9$"],"optionsAr":["$1,\\ 3,\\ 5$","$-1,\\ -3,\\ -5$","$3,\\ 5,\\ 7$","$5,\\ 7,\\ 9$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":31,"sourcePart":"next-three","sequence":{"terms":[-5,-3,-1,1],"kind":"next-three","choiceValues":[[1,3,5],[-1,-3,-5],[3,5,7],[5,7,9]]},"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q31-nth',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q31-nth","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Which formula gives the nth term of $-5,\\ -3,\\ -1,\\ 1$, … for $n=1,2,3,\\ldots$?","promptAr":"أي صيغة تعطي الحد العام للمتتابعة $-5,\\ -3,\\ -1,\\ 1$، … حيث $n=1,2,3,\\ldots$؟","answer":"$a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-5+(n-1)(2)=2n-7$.","answerAr":"الحل: $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-5+(n-1)(2)=2n-7$.","options":["$a_n=-2n-7$","$a_n=2n-5$","$a_n=-5n+2$","$a_n=2n-7$"],"optionsAr":["$a_n=-2n-7$","$a_n=2n-5$","$a_n=-5n+2$","$a_n=2n-7$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":31,"sourcePart":"nth-term","sequence":{"terms":[-5,-3,-1,1],"kind":"nth-term","choiceValues":[[-2,-7],[2,-5],[-5,2],[2,-7]]},"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p257-q31-eleventh',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p257-q31-eleventh","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find the 11th term of the arithmetic sequence $-5,\\ -3,\\ -1,\\ 1$, … .","promptAr":"أوجد الحد الحادي عشر للمتتابعة الحسابية $-5,\\ -3,\\ -1,\\ 1$، … .","answer":"$a_{11}=a_1+(11-1)d=-5+10(2)=15$.","answerAr":"الحل: $a_{11}=a_1+(11-1)d=-5+10(2)=15$.","options":["$15$","$17$","$13$","$-25$"],"optionsAr":["$15$","$17$","$13$","$-25$"],"sourcePage":257,"sourceQuestion":31,"sourcePart":"eleventh-term","sequence":{"terms":[-5,-3,-1,1],"kind":"eleventh-term","choiceValues":[15,17,13,-25]},"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-q19-nth',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-q19-nth","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences: find the nth term","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For the arithmetic sequence $-3,\\ -8,\\ -13,\\ -18$, … : (a) find the common difference; (b) write the nth-term formula for $n\\ge1$; (c) verify your formula using the first and fourth terms. Show your working.","promptAr":"للمتتابعة الحسابية $-3,\\ -8,\\ -13,\\ -18$، … : (أ) أوجد الفرق المشترك؛ (ب) اكتب صيغة الحد العام حيث $n\\ge1$؛ (ج) تحقق من الصيغة باستعمال الحدين الأول والرابع. وضح خطوات الحل.","answer":"$d=-5$. Then $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-3+(n-1)(-5)$, so $a_n=-5n+2$. Check: $a_1=-3$ and $a_4=-18$.","answerAr":"الفرق المشترك $d=-5$. بالتعويض $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-3+(n-1)(-5)$، فنحصل على $a_n=-5n+2$. للتحقق: $a_1=-3$ و$a_4=-18$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":255,"sourceQuestion":19,"responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Common difference · الفرق المشترك"},{"label":"(b) nth-term formula · صيغة الحد العام"},{"label":"(c) Verify first and fourth terms · التحقق بالحدين الأول والرابع"}],"sequence":{"terms":[-3,-8,-13,-18],"kind":"frq-nth","a1":-3,"d":-5,"coefficients":[-5,2]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-q19-apply',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-q19-apply","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Apply the arithmetic sequence formula","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"An arithmetic sequence has formula $a_n=-5n+2$ for $n\\ge1$. (a) Find $a_{101}$. (b) Find the term number n whose value is $-103$. Show substitution and solve for n.","promptAr":"متتابعة حسابية حدها العام $a_n=-5n+2$ حيث $n\\ge1$. (أ) أوجد $a_{101}$. (ب) أوجد رتبة الحد n الذي قيمته $-103$. وضح التعويض وحل المعادلة لإيجاد n.","answer":"(a) $a_{101}=-5(101)+2=-503$. (b) Solve $-103=-5n+2$ to get $n=21$. Verify by substitution; n is a positive integer.","answerAr":"(أ) $a_{101}=-5(101)+2=-503$. (ب) نحل $-103=-5n+2$، فنحصل على $n=21$. نتحقق بالتعويض؛ والرتبة عدد صحيح موجب.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":255,"sourceQuestion":19,"responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Substitute n=101 and find the term · التعويض لإيجاد الحد ١٠١"},{"label":"(b) Set the formula equal to the given value and find n · إيجاد رتبة الحد"},{"label":"Verify the term number · التحقق من رتبة الحد"}],"sequence":{"terms":[-3,-8,-13,-18],"kind":"frq-apply","a1":-3,"d":-5,"coefficients":[-5,2],"value101":-503,"target":-103,"index":21}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-q20-nth',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-q20-nth","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences: find the nth term","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For the arithmetic sequence $-2,\\ 3,\\ 8,\\ 13$, … : (a) find the common difference; (b) write the nth-term formula for $n\\ge1$; (c) verify your formula using the first and fourth terms. Show your working.","promptAr":"للمتتابعة الحسابية $-2,\\ 3,\\ 8,\\ 13$، … : (أ) أوجد الفرق المشترك؛ (ب) اكتب صيغة الحد العام حيث $n\\ge1$؛ (ج) تحقق من الصيغة باستعمال الحدين الأول والرابع. وضح خطوات الحل.","answer":"$d=5$. Then $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-2+(n-1)(5)$, so $a_n=5n-7$. Check: $a_1=-2$ and $a_4=13$.","answerAr":"الفرق المشترك $d=5$. بالتعويض $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-2+(n-1)(5)$، فنحصل على $a_n=5n-7$. للتحقق: $a_1=-2$ و$a_4=13$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":255,"sourceQuestion":20,"responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Common difference · الفرق المشترك"},{"label":"(b) nth-term formula · صيغة الحد العام"},{"label":"(c) Verify first and fourth terms · التحقق بالحدين الأول والرابع"}],"sequence":{"terms":[-2,3,8,13],"kind":"frq-nth","a1":-2,"d":5,"coefficients":[5,-7]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-q20-apply',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-q20-apply","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Apply the arithmetic sequence formula","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"An arithmetic sequence has formula $a_n=5n-7$ for $n\\ge1$. (a) Find $a_{101}$. (b) Find the term number n whose value is $73$. Show substitution and solve for n.","promptAr":"متتابعة حسابية حدها العام $a_n=5n-7$ حيث $n\\ge1$. (أ) أوجد $a_{101}$. (ب) أوجد رتبة الحد n الذي قيمته $73$. وضح التعويض وحل المعادلة لإيجاد n.","answer":"(a) $a_{101}=5(101)-7=498$. (b) Solve $73=5n-7$ to get $n=16$. Verify by substitution; n is a positive integer.","answerAr":"(أ) $a_{101}=5(101)-7=498$. (ب) نحل $73=5n-7$، فنحصل على $n=16$. نتحقق بالتعويض؛ والرتبة عدد صحيح موجب.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":255,"sourceQuestion":20,"responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Substitute n=101 and find the term · التعويض لإيجاد الحد ١٠١"},{"label":"(b) Set the formula equal to the given value and find n · إيجاد رتبة الحد"},{"label":"Verify the term number · التحقق من رتبة الحد"}],"sequence":{"terms":[-2,3,8,13],"kind":"frq-apply","a1":-2,"d":5,"coefficients":[5,-7],"value101":498,"target":73,"index":16}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-q21-nth',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-q21-nth","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences: find the nth term","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For the arithmetic sequence $-11,\\ -15,\\ -19,\\ -23$, … : (a) find the common difference; (b) write the nth-term formula for $n\\ge1$; (c) verify your formula using the first and fourth terms. Show your working.","promptAr":"للمتتابعة الحسابية $-11,\\ -15,\\ -19,\\ -23$، … : (أ) أوجد الفرق المشترك؛ (ب) اكتب صيغة الحد العام حيث $n\\ge1$؛ (ج) تحقق من الصيغة باستعمال الحدين الأول والرابع. وضح خطوات الحل.","answer":"$d=-4$. Then $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-11+(n-1)(-4)$, so $a_n=-4n-7$. Check: $a_1=-11$ and $a_4=-23$.","answerAr":"الفرق المشترك $d=-4$. بالتعويض $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-11+(n-1)(-4)$، فنحصل على $a_n=-4n-7$. للتحقق: $a_1=-11$ و$a_4=-23$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":255,"sourceQuestion":21,"responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Common difference · الفرق المشترك"},{"label":"(b) nth-term formula · صيغة الحد العام"},{"label":"(c) Verify first and fourth terms · التحقق بالحدين الأول والرابع"}],"sequence":{"terms":[-11,-15,-19,-23],"kind":"frq-nth","a1":-11,"d":-4,"coefficients":[-4,-7]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-q21-apply',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-q21-apply","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Apply the arithmetic sequence formula","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"An arithmetic sequence has formula $a_n=-4n-7$ for $n\\ge1$. (a) Find $a_{101}$. (b) Find the term number n whose value is $-63$. Show substitution and solve for n.","promptAr":"متتابعة حسابية حدها العام $a_n=-4n-7$ حيث $n\\ge1$. (أ) أوجد $a_{101}$. (ب) أوجد رتبة الحد n الذي قيمته $-63$. وضح التعويض وحل المعادلة لإيجاد n.","answer":"(a) $a_{101}=-4(101)-7=-411$. (b) Solve $-63=-4n-7$ to get $n=14$. Verify by substitution; n is a positive integer.","answerAr":"(أ) $a_{101}=-4(101)-7=-411$. (ب) نحل $-63=-4n-7$، فنحصل على $n=14$. نتحقق بالتعويض؛ والرتبة عدد صحيح موجب.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":255,"sourceQuestion":21,"responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Substitute n=101 and find the term · التعويض لإيجاد الحد ١٠١"},{"label":"(b) Set the formula equal to the given value and find n · إيجاد رتبة الحد"},{"label":"Verify the term number · التحقق من رتبة الحد"}],"sequence":{"terms":[-11,-15,-19,-23],"kind":"frq-apply","a1":-11,"d":-4,"coefficients":[-4,-7],"value101":-411,"target":-63,"index":14}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-q22-nth',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-q22-nth","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences: find the nth term","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For the arithmetic sequence $-0.75,\\ -0.5,\\ -0.25,\\ 0$, … : (a) find the common difference; (b) write the nth-term formula for $n\\ge1$; (c) verify your formula using the first and fourth terms. Show your working.","promptAr":"للمتتابعة الحسابية $-0.75,\\ -0.5,\\ -0.25,\\ 0$، … : (أ) أوجد الفرق المشترك؛ (ب) اكتب صيغة الحد العام حيث $n\\ge1$؛ (ج) تحقق من الصيغة باستعمال الحدين الأول والرابع. وضح خطوات الحل.","answer":"$d=0.25$. Then $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-0.75+(n-1)(0.25)$, so $a_n=0.25n-1$. Check: $a_1=-0.75$ and $a_4=0$.","answerAr":"الفرق المشترك $d=0.25$. بالتعويض $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=-0.75+(n-1)(0.25)$، فنحصل على $a_n=0.25n-1$. للتحقق: $a_1=-0.75$ و$a_4=0$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":255,"sourceQuestion":22,"responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Common difference · الفرق المشترك"},{"label":"(b) nth-term formula · صيغة الحد العام"},{"label":"(c) Verify first and fourth terms · التحقق بالحدين الأول والرابع"}],"sequence":{"terms":[-0.75,-0.5,-0.25,0],"kind":"frq-nth","a1":-0.75,"d":0.25,"coefficients":[0.25,-1]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-q22-apply',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-q22-apply","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Apply the arithmetic sequence formula","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"An arithmetic sequence has formula $a_n=0.25n-1$ for $n\\ge1$. (a) Find $a_{101}$. (b) Find the term number n whose value is $5.25$. Show substitution and solve for n.","promptAr":"متتابعة حسابية حدها العام $a_n=0.25n-1$ حيث $n\\ge1$. (أ) أوجد $a_{101}$. (ب) أوجد رتبة الحد n الذي قيمته $5.25$. وضح التعويض وحل المعادلة لإيجاد n.","answer":"(a) $a_{101}=0.25(101)-1=24.25$. (b) Solve $5.25=0.25n-1$ to get $n=25$. Verify by substitution; n is a positive integer.","answerAr":"(أ) $a_{101}=0.25(101)-1=24.25$. (ب) نحل $5.25=0.25n-1$، فنحصل على $n=25$. نتحقق بالتعويض؛ والرتبة عدد صحيح موجب.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":255,"sourceQuestion":22,"responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Substitute n=101 and find the term · التعويض لإيجاد الحد ١٠١"},{"label":"(b) Set the formula equal to the given value and find n · إيجاد رتبة الحد"},{"label":"Verify the term number · التحقق من رتبة الحد"}],"sequence":{"terms":[-0.75,-0.5,-0.25,0],"kind":"frq-apply","a1":-0.75,"d":0.25,"coefficients":[0.25,-1],"value101":24.25,"target":5.25,"index":25}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-designed-nth',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-designed-nth","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Construct arithmetic sequences: find the nth term","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For the arithmetic sequence $4,\\ 10,\\ 16,\\ 22$, … : (a) find the common difference; (b) write the nth-term formula for $n\\ge1$; (c) verify your formula using the first and fourth terms. Show your working.","promptAr":"للمتتابعة الحسابية $4,\\ 10,\\ 16,\\ 22$، … : (أ) أوجد الفرق المشترك؛ (ب) اكتب صيغة الحد العام حيث $n\\ge1$؛ (ج) تحقق من الصيغة باستعمال الحدين الأول والرابع. وضح خطوات الحل.","answer":"$d=6$. Then $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=4+(n-1)(6)$, so $a_n=6n-2$. Check: $a_1=4$ and $a_4=22$.","answerAr":"الفرق المشترك $d=6$. بالتعويض $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=4+(n-1)(6)$، فنحصل على $a_n=6n-2$. للتحقق: $a_1=4$ و$a_4=22$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceKind":"teacher-designed","sourceReference":"Supplementary arithmetic-sequence practice aligned with page 255; not a numbered textbook exercise.","responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Common difference · الفرق المشترك"},{"label":"(b) nth-term formula · صيغة الحد العام"},{"label":"(c) Verify first and fourth terms · التحقق بالحدين الأول والرابع"}],"sequence":{"terms":[4,10,16,22],"kind":"frq-nth","a1":4,"d":6,"coefficients":[6,-2]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('9g3-w10-p255-designed-apply',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w10-p255-designed-apply","classroom":"9G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"9G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Apply the arithmetic sequence formula","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"An arithmetic sequence has formula $a_n=6n-2$ for $n\\ge1$. (a) Find $a_{101}$. (b) Find the term number n whose value is $106$. Show substitution and solve for n.","promptAr":"متتابعة حسابية حدها العام $a_n=6n-2$ حيث $n\\ge1$. (أ) أوجد $a_{101}$. (ب) أوجد رتبة الحد n الذي قيمته $106$. وضح التعويض وحل المعادلة لإيجاد n.","answer":"(a) $a_{101}=6(101)-2=604$. (b) Solve $106=6n-2$ to get $n=18$. Verify by substitution; n is a positive integer.","answerAr":"(أ) $a_{101}=6(101)-2=604$. (ب) نحل $106=6n-2$، فنحصل على $n=18$. نتحقق بالتعويض؛ والرتبة عدد صحيح موجب.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceKind":"teacher-designed","sourceReference":"Supplementary arithmetic-sequence practice aligned with page 255; not a numbered textbook exercise.","responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Substitute n=101 and find the term · التعويض لإيجاد الحد ١٠١"},{"label":"(b) Set the formula equal to the given value and find n · إيجاد رتبة الحد"},{"label":"Verify the term number · التحقق من رتبة الحد"}],"sequence":{"terms":[4,10,16,22],"kind":"frq-apply","a1":4,"d":6,"coefficients":[6,-2],"value101":604,"target":106,"index":18}}$question_json$::jsonb)
